#X text 216 132 The punch sound is made of 2 layers mixed together, f 33;
#X text 50 238 The first is a sine oscillator whose pitch sweeps downward from 180Hz to 60Hz over 80ms., f 31;
#X text 54 331 It has a seperae amplitude envelope shaping its volume so it decays over 120ms giving it a low thud., f 31;
#X text 779 353 The second is white noise filtered through a bandpass at 1500Hz with an amplitude envelope that decays in at 50ms. This adds a sharp click on the attack, f 34;
